  16. Treat ordinary restatements such as a mandate and its acceptance criteria, or a requirement followed by its reason, as separate requirement statements that currently produce a second obligation.
       requirements: task-02
       code evidence: addressed
         16.1  src/acceptance/requirement/linking.py#@@ -0,0 +1,274 @@
         16.2  dogfood-logs/144-gate1-run1/output.log#@@ -0,0 +1,183 @@
